  message: "What we should investigate is (a) what was the motivation for the decision to classify test code as tier-2 code? what was the contemporaneous thinking and discussion when those implementations were made? and (b) what was the contemporaneous motivation, thinking, and discussion underlying the seemingly contradictory \"tier and test-ness are orthogonal axes that should not be merged\"? Understanding both is the first step."  # 7d05
